{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-02-22 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT LAUNCHES WIRELESS TEST PLATFORM FOR 5G REDCAP AND CELLULAR IOT INDUSTRY PROGRESSION', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS), A LEADING TECHNOLOGY COMPANY THAT DELIVERS ADVANCED DESIGN AND VALIDATION SOLUTIONS TO HELP ACCELERATE INNOVATION TO CONNECT AND SECURE THE WORLD, ANNOUNCED ITS NEW E7515R SOLUTION BASED ON ITS 5G NETWORK EMULATION SOLUTIONS PLATFORM, A STREAMLINED NETWORK EMULATOR SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED FOR PROTOCOL, RADIO FREQUENCY (RF), AND FUNCTIONAL TESTING OF ALL CELLULAR INTERNET OF THINGS (CIOT) TECHNOLOGIES, INCLUDING REDCAP.'}